  "rules": [
    "a name is one word of at most 12 letters (a landmark is two)",
    "no doubled letter where the stem meets the suffix",
    "unique within a planet; on a clash the salt moves on",
    "never a word from the blocklist or a real place Legal finds",
    "never a school, hospital or place of worship, and no such word in any bank (Legal c08)"
